GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Position_ShouldersOfGiantsStanding> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Position_ShouldersOfGiantsStanding> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_ShouldersOfGiantsStanding> ;
    narr:childCount "6"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "d47e17f24a950a0d71348dc45b695a3faf9b06c6" ;
    narr:narration """This position holds that builds should extend existing work rather than roll something new inside given constraints. [The steering/recall split](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_40) argues the novel part is worth keeping while recall should come from elsewhere; [the accidental-database critique](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_41) names how the hand-rolled query layer arose. [The session's concession](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_42) locates the weak link in feature-by-feature construction without an oracle, and [the shoulders-of-giants directive](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_43) generalizes it into a standing principle. [The ruled consequences](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_44) fix what stays in-house versus what comes from engine primitives, [written into a rules file](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_45).""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_40> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_41> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_42> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_43> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_44> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_45> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "separating the two could give us continued steering that we do and a query engine that does recall and precision." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_40> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Re-implementing or creating a new database is a generally known stupid thing to do unless what you're trying to do is build a database." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_41> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "I'd really like us to far more take a standing on the shoulders of giants approach at every step over and over and over again." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_43> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "steering stays ours (the perspective load, the frame index pages, the fuzzy edges, the navigator as orientation); recall and precision come from engine primitives" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_44> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The rule is written into `.claude/rules/extend-first.md`." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_45> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The ruling is not wholesale surrender: steering (perspective load, frame index, navigator) is explicitly kept in-house, with engine adoption conditional on the textbook stack tying or winning on the judged oracle." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_44> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The concession attributes the failure to construction-without-oracle, not to hand-rolling per se — a narrower diagnosis than the general anti-reimplementation principle." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_42> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_43> ] ;
    narr:run "4e43ac1885e7" ;
    narr:moved "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    narr:diffBasis "first" ;
    narr:writer "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash:nitro" .
